# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated binary document corpora. These are REGENERABLE with one command
# (python generate_real_docs.py / generate_fresh_docs.py + run_all_*.py), so we
# do not version the 440 binary .docx/.pdf files. We DO keep the human-readable
# evidence (evaluation_*.txt, *.csv, detection_quality*.txt, attack_report_*.txt)
# and the ground_truth_*.json files, which live directly in documents_*/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# original synthetic corpora (ground_truth_*.json alongside them is NOT ignored)
documents_real/docx/
documents_real/pdf/
documents_fresh/docx/
documents_fresh/pdf/
# redacted outputs: metadata-only baseline + detectors v1..v4, real and fresh sets
redacted_*/
holdout_redacted_*/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Regenerated evidence at the repo ROOT. run_all_real.py / run_all_fresh.py
# rewrite these on every run; the committed copies live in results/. The
# leading "/" anchors each pattern to the root, so the results/ copies stay tracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/evaluation_*.txt
/failed_cases_*.csv
/attack_report_*.txt
/attack_findings_*.csv
/detection_quality*.txt
